\description{
\code{wx.units()} makes a heterogeneous weather feed look consistent:
it (optionally) \strong{renames} provider-specific columns to your canonical names
and \strong{unit-converts} them to canonical target units — \emph{without} relying on
heavy unit classes. It modifies the input \code{\link[data.table:data.table]{data.table}}
\strong{by reference} and also writes a human-friendly attribute
